  "about": "Page layouts the map tries its own components in. Each layout is a CSS grid (areas) of slots; at build each slot takes the best-matching component (keywords against name, code names and cue; status full first; no repeats within a layout). An empty match draws a wireframe block. 'key' marks the layout's signature slot. Add or edit layouts here.",
